  "product_id.faq_q1": "What is the MOQ on Huayuesc?",
  "product_id.faq_a1": "The standard MOQ is shown in the price table. Some products allow a sample order first (MOQ = 1) before placing a bulk order — please send an RFQ to confirm.",
  "product_id.faq_q2": "How long is the delivery time?",
  "product_id.faq_a2": "On average 20-30 days of production + 12-18 days of DDP shipping to Hanoi/Ho Chi Minh City. Total delivery time is 32-48 days from the T/T 30% deposit.",
  "product_id.faq_q3": "Can you do OEM/ODM to drawing?",
  "product_id.faq_a3": "Yes. The supplier supports logo printing, color changes, and custom dimensions to your technical drawings. The sample fee is typically $50-200 and is credited against the main order once the MOQ is placed.",
  "product_id.faq_q4": "How does Huayuesc protect transactions?",
  "product_id.faq_a4": "Trade Assurance: funds are held in Huayuesc's escrow account and released to the supplier only after the buyer confirms the goods match the description. 100% refund if commitments are not met.",
  "product_id.faq_q5": "What does the DDP shipping fee include?",
  "product_id.faq_a5": "It includes ocean/road freight, import duties, VAT, customs clearance, transit warehouse fees, and domestic Vietnam delivery to the buyer's warehouse. The buyer handles no paperwork.",
